Struts 6.xx application
Uses java 13 SE
uses JdbcTemplate for DAO objects to access the database.  The actual Jdbc Object is passed to the DAO in the constructor from the Service Object.
    public NameDAO(NamedParameterJdbcTemplate template) {
        this.template = template;
    }

On the UI, I use 
JSP, 
Apache tiles, 
Bootstrap 4.6.2
jquery-3.2.1.min


• Servlet container: Apache Tomcat 9.0.89 (Java EE / javax.* environment)
• JSP/JSTL: JSP 2.3 + JSTL 1.2 (http://java.sun.com/jsp/jstl/core)



